    "assessment": "The smooth version reads clearer and more polished, especially in the head grooves and broad neck/body refraction. The geometric version has a grainier, more crystalline character. The change is visible when toggled at whole-scene size and easier in the crops; both retain the same overall glass-dragon composition. For this demo I would treat it as an appearance choice and let visual payoff decide its priority.",
    "fidelity": "The private geometric build reproduces the ordinary renderer byte for byte in both PNG and raw HDR at the 960 \u00d7 540 / 128-SPP pilot. Its full-HD geometric images differ from the retained Q0.1 images by at most 1 RGB8 code per channel; they are not universally byte-identical.",
